<title>USA: Storage USA president, CFO Robinson resigns.</title>
<headline>Storage USA president, CFO Robinson resigns.</headline>
<dateline>MEMPHIS, Tenn. 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Storage USA Inc said on Wednesday that Thomas Robinson, president and chief financial officer, resigned to take a position with Legg Mason Wood Walker Inc.</p>
<p>Storage USA said that Dennis Reeve has been named to the position of chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Reeve has been a director of the company since April 13, 1994 and has served as chairman of the audit committee and a member of the compensation committee, the company said.</p>
